[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2527800072","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100199#issuecomment-2527800072","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100199","id":2527800072,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WqysI","user":{"login":"Alex-Jalonen","id":71279927,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjc5OTI3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71279927?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Jalonen","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex-Jalonen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Jalonen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Jalonen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Jalonen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Jalonen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Jalonen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Jalonen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Jalonen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Jalonen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Jalonen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-09T12:31:45Z","updated_at":"2024-12-09T12:31:45Z","body":"I will also add that I was able to circumvent this bug in my own project by changing the structure of my bullet scene. When I deleted (this did not work if I just move the synchronizers position) but when I deleted the synchronizer and recreated it as a child of an intermediary node between it and the scene root, the freezing behavior stopped occuring. I suspect the root path value may play some role in the reason this bug occurs.\n\nI'll include an altered MRP here which lets you spawn an alternate Dyanmic Element. This alt element will be structured differently and you should see that any amount of spawning and despawning does